Domain Entity StaffRequisition
    documentation "This entity represents the requisition to fill an open staff position within the education organization."
    shared string RequisitionNumber
        documentation "Identifier assigned to the position to be filled.  Typically a number assigned by Human Resources that is associated with the specific position." 
        is part of identity
    domain entity OpenStaffPosition
        documentation "Reference to OpenStaffPosition the Education Organization is seeking to fill."
        is part of identity
    descriptor EmploymentStatus
        documentation "Reflects the type of employment or contract desired for the position."
        is required
    date DatePosted
        documentation "DatePosted indicates the date that the requisition was posted."
        is required
    date DatePostingClosed
        documentation "The date the posting was removed or filled."
        is optional
    descriptor PostingClosedReason
        documentation "PostingClosedReason indicates whether the position was filled or closed unfilled."
        is optional
    date HireDate
        documentation "HireDate is the first day a staff member is employed at an educational organization."
        is optional


